WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.283
The headline numbers tell the story.

00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:10.195
USIS10K brings 10,632 annotated underwater images
across seven categories.

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:15.613
On class-agnostic segmentation, USIS-SAM reaches 59.7 mAP,

00:00:15.693 --> 00:00:20.750
with 81.6 AP at fifty percent and 67.7 at seventy-five.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.019
On multi-class it reaches 43.1 mAP.

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:34.761
Ablations attribute 1.6 mAP to the Underwater
Adaptive ViT encoder and 0.9 to the Salient Feature Prompt Generator.

00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:41.300
Training used 24 epochs on six NVIDIA 3090 GPUs
with a ViT-H backbone.
